<title>USA: Competitive sales total $451 mln for Sept 18.</title>
<headline>Competitive sales total $451 mln for Sept 18.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled competitive bond sales total $451 million in 10 offerings for Wednesday, September 18, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>The largest issue is a $200 million Massachusetts general obligation bond issue at 1000 EDT.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
